1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:00,320
= kisskh.lv =

2
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:17,250
Cha Dohyun!

3
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:19,760
Why did you leave without telling me?

4
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:22,360
Worried I'll try to
borrow your uniform again?

5
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:24,180
I'm dressed properly today.

6
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:36,270
Hey, are you sick?

7
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:38,630
Did you catch a cold in the rain yesterd—

8
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:43,350
Don't touch me.

9
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:51,490
What's with him?

10
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:16,020
[Sung Inho]

11
00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:22,650
[Kim Domin]

12
00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:45,190
[Summertime]

13
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,320
What the heck?

14
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:44,320
Good morning.

15
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:46,000
-Good morning.
-Good morning.

16
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,340
Hello.

17
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:52,030
Where's the energy, boys?

18
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:54,520
Alright.

19
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:57,910
We have a new transfer student.

20
00:03:59,690 --> 00:04:01,430
Quiet. Quiet down.

21
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:04,440
He's transferring in his
third year of high school,

22
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,120
a really hectic time.

23
00:04:06,250 --> 00:04:08,230
It's very overwhelming for him.

24
00:04:08,270 --> 00:04:11,530
Help him whenever you can,
so he can get settled in quickly.

25
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,280
Got it?

26
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,210
Yes.

27
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:14,290
Good.

28
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,430
[Cha Dohyun]

29
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,839
You always do whatever you want.

30
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:23,080
[Cha Dohyun]

31
00:04:23,330 --> 00:04:26,500
[OMG. So cute.]

32
00:04:26,670 --> 00:04:29,840
[Cha Dohyun: It kept meowing in front
of my house in the middle of the night.]

33
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:33,010
[Don't think I can keep it. I'll get it
treated and put up for adoption.]

34
00:04:33,230 --> 00:04:35,159
He looks so creepy.

35
00:04:37,670 --> 00:04:39,930
It's exhausting just looking at him.

36
00:04:40,230 --> 00:04:41,680
He looks so needy.

37
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:42,960
Again?

38
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:47,940
Yihyun, you can sit over there.

39
00:04:48,810 --> 00:04:49,740
Okay.

40
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,720
Go on.

41
00:04:51,540 --> 00:04:53,500
[Cha Dohyun: I'll get it treated
and put up for adoption.]

42
00:04:53,580 --> 00:04:56,000
[I looked it up. It might be pink eye.]

43
00:04:56,110 --> 00:04:58,710
[I'll go with you
to the vet after school!]

44
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,140
Eunho's so lucky.

45
00:05:11,430 --> 00:05:12,960
What are you looking at? Look ahead!

46
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:13,860
Yes!

47
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:17,290
The college entrance exam is coming up.

48
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:20,520
Don't slack off, got it?

49
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,540
Yes.

50
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:25,510
Alright. Get ready for class.
See you later.

51
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:32,930
Hey.

52
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:34,700
Hey!

53
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:36,840
Hey!

54
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:41,000
You're new here. You should
go around greeting your classmates.

55
00:05:41,620 --> 00:05:44,190
You're a third year,
so it must be a forced transfer.

56
00:05:44,190 --> 00:05:45,450
Definitely.

57
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,620
Hey! Hello?

58
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,150
Do you hear me?

59
00:05:51,610 --> 00:05:52,840
Hello?

60
00:05:53,090 --> 00:05:54,480
Maybe he's deaf.

61
00:05:54,860 --> 00:05:57,610
Hey! Hey!

62
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:02,030
Shut up and get lost.

63
00:06:03,450 --> 00:06:06,360
So arrogant.
I knew it from his weird eyes.

64
00:06:10,990 --> 00:06:12,330
Your eyes...

65
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,920
Friend,

66
00:06:15,150 --> 00:06:17,130
stop staring at me. It's annoying.

67
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:18,990
Who do you think you are?

68
00:06:20,110 --> 00:06:21,920
His hair's cute.

69
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:23,670
What a nicely-shaped head.

70
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:27,550
OMG, you flinched!

71
00:06:27,810 --> 00:06:30,210
Look at his face. I know he got scared!

72
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:32,320
Dude, you're so soft.

73
00:06:33,970 --> 00:06:35,340
Are you dumb?

74
00:06:35,570 --> 00:06:37,230
I'm just showing you some concern.

75
00:06:37,230 --> 00:06:40,050
Why are you so sensitive, you loser—

76
00:06:44,230 --> 00:06:45,400
I'm just here to graduate.

77
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:46,909
Please cooperate.

78
00:06:49,930 --> 00:06:51,730
What the hell...

79
00:06:52,170 --> 00:06:53,300
He asked us to cooperate.

80
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:56,330
Why do I have to cooperate?

81
00:06:58,090 --> 00:07:00,270
What are you glaring at?

82
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,790
Smile.

83
00:07:02,760 --> 00:07:03,870
Smile, you idiot!

84
00:07:04,050 --> 00:07:04,920
Why are you so serious—

85
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,170
Hey, stop it.

86
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:08,560
What?

87
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:09,860
That's enough.

88
00:07:12,100 --> 00:07:14,300
Are you the only ones in this classroom?

89
00:07:14,770 --> 00:07:16,620
You're so noisy.

90
00:07:18,510 --> 00:07:19,480
Bloody hell.

91
00:07:19,650 --> 00:07:23,320
You saw everything.
He was the one who was being a rude prick.

92
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:27,340
Who's the rude prick here?

93
00:07:29,210 --> 00:07:30,340
You were hitting him

94
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:32,580
and sexually harassing him.

95
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:35,180
Are you really surprised he was hostile?

96
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:36,210
Huh?

97
00:07:39,710 --> 00:07:40,950
Oh, I see.

98
00:07:41,050 --> 00:07:43,580
Did he go down on you?

99
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:47,020
Why are you so defensive of him?

100
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:51,380
It's better than you going down on me.

101
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,170
Go look in a mirror.

102
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,570
What the hell?

103
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:57,380
Stop! Stop!

104
00:07:57,540 --> 00:07:59,170
Eunho! Stop...

105
00:08:00,550 --> 00:08:02,040
That bastard!

106
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,450
Calm down.

107
00:08:04,650 --> 00:08:05,620
Screw this.

108
00:08:20,130 --> 00:08:21,200
Thanks.

109
00:08:31,670 --> 00:08:34,270
If you want to thank me,
buy me something to eat.

110
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,809
You're not going to have lunch?

111
00:08:42,950 --> 00:08:45,200
Yeah, the food today isn't good.

112
00:08:47,070 --> 00:08:49,390
Don't you have to eat with them?

113
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:55,330
You don't have to worry about me.

114
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,470
Anyway, thank you.

115
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:09,310
What was your name again?

116
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,870
Kwon Yihyun.

117
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:15,900
Yihyun.

118
00:09:18,810 --> 00:09:20,290
Are you rich?

119
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,220
Why did you transfer?

120
00:09:37,430 --> 00:09:39,890
You don't have to tell me
if you don't want to.

121
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,460
I'm gay.

122
00:09:46,970 --> 00:09:48,030
I see.

123
00:09:52,010 --> 00:09:54,220
After some classmates found out,

124
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:57,060
the bullying got severe.

125
00:09:57,660 --> 00:10:00,070
Things got really out of hand.

126
00:10:00,890 --> 00:10:05,450
The school strongly implied
that I transfer.

127
00:10:08,770 --> 00:10:11,290
What a horrible school.

128
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:16,780
I said I like guys.

129
00:10:17,190 --> 00:10:19,070
It must've been tough.

130
00:10:20,540 --> 00:10:21,870
Are you okay with that?

131
00:10:24,570 --> 00:10:25,750
Hey.

132
00:10:27,970 --> 00:10:30,300
It's none of my business
that you like guys.

133
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:32,150
Is my opinion important?

134
00:10:36,330 --> 00:10:37,660
Do you like me?

135
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:45,060
Right, what you think doesn't matter.

136
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:49,530
It's just that people
don't usually react like that.

137
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,400
You can have this.

138
00:11:14,370 --> 00:11:16,770
Why are you eating snacks
instead of lunch?

139
00:11:18,310 --> 00:11:19,650
Are you my mom?

140
00:11:20,550 --> 00:11:22,630
Have you eaten?
Why didn't you text me back?

141
00:11:22,630 --> 00:11:23,630
I was busy

142
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:26,130
preparing for the student council forum.

143
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:29,180
Council president work won't feed you.

144
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:31,930
Don't break your back over it.

145
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,510
Can I give it to him?

146
00:11:41,690 --> 00:11:42,710
Yeah.

147
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:49,220
He paid for it.

148
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,270
I looked it up.

149
00:11:52,430 --> 00:11:54,090
The cat probably has pink eye.

150
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:56,210
All it needs is eye drops.

151
00:11:56,330 --> 00:11:58,010
If you're busy,

152
00:11:58,140 --> 00:11:59,810
I'll go by myself.

153
00:12:02,430 --> 00:12:03,690
It'll be over at eight.

154
00:12:03,890 --> 00:12:05,400
I'll call you. Let's...

155
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:06,780
I'll go with you.

156
00:12:11,370 --> 00:12:13,320
I had a pet cat.

157
00:12:13,490 --> 00:12:14,750
You'll need help.

158
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,660
Really? Perfect.

159
00:12:16,770 --> 00:12:18,570
Let's go together after school.

160
00:12:20,020 --> 00:12:21,620
I haven't seen you before.

161
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:26,640
He's a new transfer student.

162
00:12:26,780 --> 00:12:27,380
Say hi.

163
00:12:27,500 --> 00:12:29,070
He's my friend, Cha Dohyun.

164
00:12:31,230 --> 00:12:32,680
You are...

165
00:12:33,370 --> 00:12:34,950
Kwon Yihyun.

166
00:12:35,450 --> 00:12:36,160
Hello.

167
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:38,730
Transferring midway
through your third year

168
00:12:38,730 --> 00:12:40,340
can only mean one thing.

169
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,900
Yeo Eunho,

170
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:45,880
you should know
how to pick the right friends by now.

171
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:48,190
Sheesh, where did that come from?

172
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:51,270
If I'm being picky,
I have to cut ties with you first.

173
00:12:52,430 --> 00:12:53,810
Are you two close?

174
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,130
Yup.

175
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,540
He has a nasty temper,

176
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:01,710
so I'm his only friend.

177
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:07,020
You're the one with the nasty temper
without any other friends.

178
00:13:08,770 --> 00:13:11,670
We're childhood friends by circumstance.

179
00:13:11,980 --> 00:13:13,200
I see.

180
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:19,710
Childhood friends by circumstance, huh?

181
00:13:23,890 --> 00:13:25,580
What are you doing?

182
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:26,930
Don't you need my gym uniform?

183
00:13:26,930 --> 00:13:27,990
When did I say that?

184
00:13:28,110 --> 00:13:29,570
It's PE class next.

185
00:13:31,470 --> 00:13:32,760
Yihyun, see you later.

186
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:41,530
What's your problem? I can't breathe!

187
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:43,580
Call me like that too.

188
00:13:44,370 --> 00:13:45,460
What?

189
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:48,320
Call me Dohyun.

190
00:13:48,690 --> 00:13:51,540
Did you wake up
on the wrong side of the bed?

191
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,760
Dohyun. Dohyun!

192
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:11,010
Wait.

193
00:14:13,990 --> 00:14:15,110
What are you doing?

194
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:18,630
What's wrong? It's not like
you've never seen me change.

195
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:44,440
See you.

196
00:14:51,650 --> 00:14:54,590
[Yeo Eunho]

197
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,660
[Yeo Eunho]

198
00:14:54,710 --> 00:14:58,710
This short story was
originally titled "Girl."

199
00:14:58,860 --> 00:15:00,930
Why did the writer change the title?

200
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,350
Let's find out.

201
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:04,800
"Rain Shower."

202
00:15:05,060 --> 00:15:07,780
Short and impactful.

203
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:09,710
It's a sudden downpour

204
00:15:09,870 --> 00:15:11,600
that leaves you no time to hide,

205
00:15:11,670 --> 00:15:13,700
but it's over before you know it.

206
00:15:14,340 --> 00:15:17,090
But after getting soaked,

207
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:19,520
your body becomes wet and sticky.

208
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,630
It's hard to dry off.

209
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:23,340
It leaves its trace.

210
00:15:23,450 --> 00:15:24,470
Stop it!

211
00:15:23,780 --> 00:15:26,380
[Yeo Eunho]

212
00:15:24,470 --> 00:15:26,470
Like the girl's sweater stained

213
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:29,010
purple by grass.

214
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:49,910
[Yeo Eunho]

215
00:16:03,020 --> 00:16:07,090
It was too heavy to be mere discomfort,

216
00:16:07,790 --> 00:16:12,060
and too viscerally sticky
to be called jealousy.

217
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:52,340
[Yeo Eunho: I almost forgot.
Give me back my uniform.]

218
00:16:52,370 --> 00:16:54,130
[Yeo Eunho: Check this out.]

219
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:09,390
Where are you?

220
00:17:09,599 --> 00:17:11,130
Home, duh.

221
00:17:11,950 --> 00:17:12,940
Just the two of you?

222
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:13,930
Yeah.

223
00:17:14,060 --> 00:17:16,060
By the way, we went to the vet, and...

224
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:51,240
You sure you can take it home with you?

225
00:17:52,990 --> 00:17:54,060
Yeah.

226
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:57,640
My oldest sister's been depressed
since our cat passed.

227
00:17:57,820 --> 00:18:00,480
She's a freelancer and home all day.

228
00:18:00,650 --> 00:18:03,310
It's better for it
to stay at my place than yours.

229
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:05,570
At least eat before you go.

230
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:08,840
I'm good.

231
00:18:19,130 --> 00:18:21,000
Hey, why are you here?

232
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:29,480
I'm off. See you tomorrow.

233
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,240
Okay. Be safe.

234
00:18:34,220 --> 00:18:35,290
Cha Dohyun!

235
00:18:35,990 --> 00:18:38,520
Where are you going?
Aren't you here to see me?

236
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:41,040
There's something I have to do.

237
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:42,390
All of a sudden?

238
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:45,220
Yeah.

239
00:18:46,010 --> 00:18:49,520
Hey. Hey! Leaving just like that?

240
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:04,920
Leave him alone.

241
00:19:10,190 --> 00:19:11,680
Is this your cat?

242
00:19:12,700 --> 00:19:14,760
I thought it didn't belong to anyone.

243
00:19:18,130 --> 00:19:20,670
Answer me. Is it yours?

244
00:19:20,790 --> 00:19:21,960
Shut up.

245
00:19:21,970 --> 00:19:23,270
You like Yeo Eunho, don't you?

246
00:19:23,270 --> 00:19:24,670
Shut up.

247
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:27,230
If not,

248
00:19:27,910 --> 00:19:29,510
can I like him?

249
00:19:35,650 --> 00:19:38,270
Do you really not know,
or are you pretending?

250
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:43,650
Hey!

251
00:19:48,210 --> 00:19:50,000
Back off.

252
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:54,870
He

253
00:19:55,350 --> 00:19:56,850
is mine.

254
00:20:08,230 --> 00:20:14,820
[Summertime]

255
00:20:14,850 --> 00:20:17,080
Let's go for tteokbokki after school.

256
00:20:19,330 --> 00:20:20,460
Where are you going?

257
00:20:20,610 --> 00:20:22,020
Get out of my way!

258
00:20:22,340 --> 00:20:23,340
Let go!

259
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:25,880
I figured if I hung around you
long enough,

260
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:27,490
you'd eventually be mine.

261
00:20:27,500 --> 00:20:30,280
But now it feels like
you're slipping through my fingers.

262
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:31,570
Cha Dohyun...

263
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,530
you've been acting strange.

264
00:20:33,530 --> 00:20:34,530
Eunho.

265
00:20:35,670 --> 00:20:37,160
Just believe what you see.

266
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:39,390
Cha Dohyun, you're not alone.

267
00:20:39,660 --> 00:20:41,790
I'll be with you till the day I die.

268
00:20:42,290 --> 00:20:45,130
You're the only one I have.
